// Title: AWS EC2 Startup Shell Script Change
// ID: 1ab3c5ed-5baf-417b-bb6b-78ca33f6c3df
// Status: test
// Level: high
// Author: faloker
// Date: 2020-02-12
// Tags: attack.execution, attack.t1059.001, attack.t1059.003, attack.t1059.004
// Description: Detects changes to the EC2 instance startup script. The shell script will be executed as root/SYSTEM every time the specific instances are booted up.
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

source = logs-* | where (eventSource = "ec2.amazonaws.com" AND requestParameters.attribute = "userData" AND eventName = "ModifyInstanceAttribute")
